# Launch records. The token address and tx of a real launch are public, but the
# record is written by a laptop and belongs to it, not to the repository.
tools/out/

# The real launch config. The salt in it decides the token address, so a salt
# in a public repository is a token address anyone can take before we do.
# tools/launch.config.example.json is the shape, with the salt, the recipients
# and the description left as placeholders.
tools/launch.config.json
